  triage:notes "S14-FTQ-001 is the sprint-scoped ID for QA report FTQ-002. The existing FTQ-002.ttl record covers a different finding. Crate-scope sweep found additional yield_now occurrences outside file_filter scope (tests.rs:252, daemon_observability.rs:957, shutdown_beacon.rs:27,47, atm/log.rs:171) — these are out-of-scope for this finding but noted for awareness." ;
